---
<section class="bottom-cta-section bg-white">
  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="cta-block boxed-cta">
      <div class="row align-center">
        <div class="col-half">
          <h3 class="cta-heading">Deep Dive into the Strategy.</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="col-half right-content">
          <p class="cta-text font-secondary">
            Access detailed performance metrics and the full investment thesis.
          </p>
          
          <div class="buttons-container">
            <a href="#" class="btn-arrow-link">
              <span class="icon-box">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="link-text">DOWNLOAD PRESENTATION</span>
            </a>
            
            <a href="#" class="btn-arrow-link">
              <span class="icon-box">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="link-text">REQUEST FACTSHEET & DETAILS</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <div class="cta-block">
      <div class="centered-content">
        <p class="disclosure-text font-secondary">
          <strong>Regulatory Disclosure:</strong> Karma Capital Portfolio Management Services (PMS) are investment avenues for high-net-worth investors. The minimum investment ticket size is INR 50 Lakhs. Investments in securities market are subject to market risks. Read all the related documents carefully before investing. Past performance is not indicative of future results.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .bottom-cta-section {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  
  .cta-block {
    padding: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .boxed-cta {
    border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      padding: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4rem;
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }

  .align-center {
    align-items: center;
  }

  .col-half {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
  }
  
  .right-content {
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .buttons-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .centered-content {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: #eaeaea;
    width: 100%;
  }
  
  .cta-text, .disclosure-text {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0;

    strong {
      color: #333;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  }

  .btn-arrow-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    
    .icon-box {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      background-color: #75b0e2; /* Brand blue */
      border-radius: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .link-text {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    &:hover {
      .icon-box {
        background-color: #5a98d0;
      }
      .link-text {
        color: #75b0e2;
      }
    }
  }

  .cta-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
</style>
